 Factor w/ 2 levels "Inland","Shore": 2 1 2 1 2 1 2 1 2 1

So I'm assuming when I do as.numeric() it is taking the 1s and the 2s? Not really sure what's going on with this either... But agree that I can just get separate estimates for detection on shore and compare it to inland estimates.

